    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1291" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀδιάλλακτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>irreconcilable</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ πρὸς ὑμᾶς ἀ. ὑπάρχει</span>
			my relation to you <i>admits no reconciliation</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				2.21
			</span></i>, cf.<i><span class="en">
				24.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.Chr.
				38.17
			</span></i>, etc. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως, ἔχειν πρός τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					6.56
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Brut.</u>
				45
			</span></i>.</div>
